      en: ["The cathedral was built over a period of 15 years, concluding in 1950.", "It features a distinct Neo-Romanesque design with twin square towers.", "The building serves as the seat of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Bissau.", "It is located in the historic center, known as Bissau Velho.", "The towers were historically used as a light beacon for the Geba River.", "Pope John Paul II visited this cathedral during his 1990 apostolic journey."],
      es: ["La construcción se inició en 1935 y se inauguró oficialmente en 1950.", "La catedral está construida en el estilo neorrománico del modernismo portugués.", "Es la sede de la diócesis católica romana de Bissau.", "Sus dos torres distintivas sirven como punto de orientación para el puerto.", "En la catedral se encuentra una estatua de la patrona Nossa Senhora da Candelária.", "El Papa Juan Pablo II visitó la catedral durante su viaje a África en 1990."],
