      en: ["Kansalá served as the capital of the Kaabu Empire for several centuries.", "The city was leveled in 1867 following the historic Battle of Kansalá.", "The site is a major cultural landmark for Mandinka history and identity.", "It is located near the modern-day city of Gabú in eastern Guinea-Bissau.", "The destruction of the city led to the total collapse of the Kaabu state.", "Remains of the royal compound can still be identified by stone outlines."],
