      en: ["The town was renamed Canchungo in 1974 to erase the colonial legacy.", "It is the primary cultural heartland of the Manjaco ethnic group.", "The site witnessed intense resistance against Portuguese expansion in 1913.", "It served as a major inland port for the distribution of European goods.", "Colonial villas in the center showcase unique tropical-lusitanian styles.", "Canchungo remains a strategic transport hub in northwestern Guinea-Bissau."],
